title: XenServer / XCP-ng: VM disk
agents: xenserver
catalog: app/citrix
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk

description:
 This check shows throughput, IOPS and latency of a virtual disk (VBD) of a
 VM, together with the VDI name, SR and size. Optional levels on latency.
 Data comes from the special agent {agent_xenserver}.

discovery:
 One service per virtual disk (CD drives are skipped). The item is the device name, e.g. xvda.
